<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Where, by reason of its nature, size or amount, it is not practicable to remove any fuel, conveyance, machinery, contrivance, equipment, book, record, document or other article seized under this section, the enforcement officer shall, by any means, seal such fuel, conveyance, machinery, contrivance, equipment, book, record, document or other article in the premises or container in which it is found."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
