<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who, without lawful authority, breaks, tampers with or damages the seal referred to in subsection (5) or removes the fuel, conveyance, machinery, contrivance, equipment, book, record, document or other article under seal, or attempts to do so commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both. Search and seizure without warrant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
