<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_21> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "21" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
