<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_21__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "enter and search such place or premises;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_21__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
