<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any enforcement officer conducting a search under this Act shall be given access to computerized data whether stored in a computer or otherwise."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
