<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_26__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "A notice under subsection (4) need not be given if the seizure is made in the presence or with the knowledge of the owner. Temporary return of conveyance, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
