<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_27__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any conveyance, machinery, contrivance or equipment is seized under this Act, the court may temporarily return the conveyance, machinery, contrivance or equipment to the owner of the conveyance, machinery, contrivance or equipment or the person from whose possession, custody or control it was seized, subject to such terms and conditions as the court may impose, and subject in any case to sufficient security being furnished to the satisfaction of the court that the conveyance, machinery, contrivance or equipment shall be surrendered to the court on demand and that such terms and conditions, if any, shall be complied with."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
