<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_43__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The licensing authority may require any person undertaking any activity involving fuel to furnish to the licensing authority information relating to the composition and use of such fuel."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_43__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_III__cl_43> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
