<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Every application under subsection (1) shall be accompanied by such document or information as may be prescribed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
