<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where a body corporate commits an offence under this Act, any person who at the time of the commission of the offence was a director, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the body corporate or was purporting to act in any such capacity or was in any manner or to any extent responsible for the management of any of the affairs of the body corporate or was assisting in such management—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "may be charged severally or jointly in the same proceedings with the body corporate; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_b__subpara_i> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_b__subpara_ii> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_49__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
