<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The provisions of this Act shall be in addition to, and not in derogation of, the provisions of any other written law relating to fuel."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/eng@> .
